{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "0c8601e8754957b225c3aa949447e6171e9505e5e311a7e9d085be90addb4361", "ja": "こ、これが、ありさの新しい衣装……実に素晴らしい！\n大宇宙のパワーを感じます……ムフ、ムフフ♪", "zh": "这、这就是亚利沙的新服装……实在是太棒了！\n\n我感受到了大宇宙的力量……唔呼、唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1001_p", "source_sha256": "32ec6372c002179f9e32c0cf2e8496ca9d093455c749bce3b026a60c05ebdce2", "ja": "お疲れ様、亜利沙。\n衣装はどうだ、問題ないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，亚利沙。\n新服装怎么样，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "751f2e8001443ba333d3dfe2a41738f64622cd16c74fe6ccd1c84fd2eabde193", "ja": "むむっ、こんなところにも矢印がっ！\n細部までしっかり作り込まれていて……ぶつぶつ。", "zh": "唔唔，连这种地方也有箭头！\n连细节都做得这么到位……嘀咕嘀咕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f1be092d3d31acdabdc932696509aee01694969463efa746b03648e0dc419364", "ja": "……えっと、亜利沙？　おーい！", "zh": "……那个，亚利沙？喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "9cd44cfbc8cef2309b56d265105a7bcb631f3be5c3ae2a3b955f0eb0598d7ae6", "ja": "うひぃっ！？　{$P$}さん！？\n息を潜めて脅かすのはナシですよぉ！", "zh": "呜哇！？　{$P$}先生！？\n屏住呼吸吓人可不行啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1005_p", "source_sha256": "660b8f2876a3857d40a2e5543e94ad689126ae7db43a2a3c5a23add8f7d21e42", "ja": "いや脅かしてないけど……。\n亜利沙が集中し過ぎてただけだよ。", "zh": "不，我可没吓你啊……\n只是亚利沙你看得太入神了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "4864221f82b4011be0b780222d52ca4ad7c387078810662b9ac74578339a421f", "ja": "ハッ！？　またやっちゃいましたか？　失礼しました！\nつい衣装に感動してしまって、観察してたもので……。", "zh": "啊！？　我又这样了吗？真是失礼了！\n因为一不小心被服装感动了，就观察起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ff5b2dc0d42ab331f8208f555668214c1b5638cdcf546ea3bc73c0159938e40", "ja": "ははっ。それくらい気に入ってくれたってことだろ？\nなら良かった。", "zh": "哈哈，看来你很喜欢这套服装嘛？那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "31b6083cd72ba260cd010dab11c8b818bf9028f19ec5597f76d861712f1cde8c", "ja": "はいっ！　だって、見てください！\n宇宙服をモチーフにした、この素晴らしい衣装を！", "zh": "是的！因为，请您看看！\n这套以宇航服为灵感设计的华丽服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "5170cf9553323acd944ada89274eaeef344f9396b5b27e381346fe9e5794658f", "ja": "まるで、ありさにアイドル界という名の宇宙を\n飛び回れと言っているようなものだと思いませんか！", "zh": "简直就像是在对我说，要在名为偶像界的宇宙中到处翱翔一样，您不觉得吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1010_p", "source_sha256": "242fd483ab7295a053b50b17f7c588475ea5dc4e66ab3fc543904abfc6df389b", "ja": "アイドル界という名の宇宙、か……確かに、たくさんの\nアイドルがいるし、そう言えるくらい広い業界かもな。", "zh": "名为偶像界的宇宙吗……确实，那里有许多偶像，说是个如此广阔的行业也不为过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "028033240ca908501334d4f0c5415ccced17ddf0b47a724c018f22125648ba73", "ja": "そうなんです！　劇場のアイドルちゃんたちは、\n宇宙の中でも、ひときわ眩しく輝いてますよぉ！", "zh": "就是这样！剧场里的偶像们，在宇宙中也格外耀眼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "a24b6c26ef7e1c02368783127cec0b80d50b69efcbe647831dd9e668ff5ad915", "ja": "でもでも、みんな魅力的すぎて……。\nあっちもこっちもと、ありさの目が足りません！", "zh": "可是可是，大家都太有魅力了……  \n这边也想看，那边也想看，亚利沙的眼睛根本不够用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1013_p", "source_sha256": "be3f52537bb3a70010ff66f32435d5aa77b0307e0d12129ea5c19c8e9fe40dcc", "ja": "なんだかわかる気がするよ……。いろんなアイドルに\n目移りして、行ったり来たりするんだよな。", "zh": "好像能理解你的感受……面对各种各样的偶像，目光总会在这边和那边之间来回游移。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c23e621cf53edcfec1cd487cfa3a3bf596d4a449da14665db5822c8eccb281b", "ja": "だけど、忘れてないか？\n亜利沙も、宇宙に輝く星のひとつだってことを。", "zh": "但是，你是不是忘了？亚利沙也是闪耀在宇宙中的一颗星啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "d4dbedd2aeb14ec6e8a19df445ef7f393069f0501c3475510999e60cfccf4dbe", "ja": "わ、わかってますよ～！　ありさも、ちょっとは、\nアイドルちゃんをやってる自覚はありますから……！", "zh": "我、我知道啦～！我多少也有在当偶像的自觉嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "d5965ad3a07a07886d02d9cc2021e97cc24cb051f9d0bd6d4d3092859f253552", "ja": "それに、衣装を着たらワクワクが止まらなくて。\nファンの人達にも、早く見てもらいたいです！", "zh": "而且，穿上服装后就让人激动得停不下来。也想让粉丝们早点看到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1017_p", "source_sha256": "76dbefbedb70017bb99625fa46d9641fa780606ab9406a583b94824082447248", "ja": "そうだな。さっきの亜利沙みたいに、\nみんなも夢中になってくれると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得大家也会像刚才的亚利沙那样，完全着迷的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb216d262a438f8a08f3d0f8b6b5c79eeee7613bb6bca16f2abbcaa47a2c654c", "ja": "ムフフ、そうですね♪\n{$P$}さん、見ててください！", "zh": "唔呼呼，说得对呢♪\n{$P$}先生，请看好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "52ed924a2f639d70dd521d9baaf9a2d384cb00048b0d52d7c852b91fe76ed97b", "ja": "劇場のアイドルちゃんたちのような\nキラキラの星に、ありさもなってみせますよぉ！", "zh": "我也要成为像剧场里的偶像女孩们那样，闪闪发光的星星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c4bc61e8f31eee12779d1cabe47bf7c2a1c304d2200ba56c9e38d61d596614fe", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！　思いっきり宇宙を飛び回って、\n松田亜利沙という輝きを見せてくれ。応援してるぞ！", "zh": "啊，就是这股干劲！尽情遨游宇宙，让大家见识一下名为松田亚利沙的光辉吧。我会为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0344_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "0066313aa883c34275d2bbf4ff349ed5b9ccf379bfc9e2576205928818c3ffb7", "ja": "はい！　アイドルちゃんとして、\n全宇宙を照らしあげちゃいますよ～！　ムフフ～♪", "zh": "好的！作为偶像，我要把整个宇宙都照亮～！呜呼呼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
